局。自國子禮生射策高第，爲寧海令，稍遷湘東王記室參軍，又轉中記室。太清中，侯景亂，世祖承制上流，書檄多委鐧焉，鐧亦竭力盡忠，甚蒙賞遇。歷尚書左丞、御史中丞。承聖二年，遷吏部尚書、國子祭酒，餘如故。","text_layer":"received_chapter","annotation_status":"named_mentions_first_pass","source_position":{"first_line":30,"last_line":30,"revision_id":1512987,"raw_start":1839,"raw_end":1968,"raw_character_offsets":[1841,1842,1843,1844,1845,1846,1847,1848,1849,1850,1851,1852,1853,1854,1855,1856,1857,1858,1859,1860,1861,1862,1863,1864,1865,1866,1867,1868,1869,1870,1871,1872,1873,1874,1875,1876,1877,1878,1879,1880,1881,1882,1883,1884,1885,1886,1887,1888,1889,1890,1891,1892,1893,1894,1895,1896,1897,1898,1899,1900,1901,1902,1903,1904,1905,1906,1907,1908,1909,1910,1911,1912,1913,1914,1915,1916,1917,1918,1919,1920,1921,1922,1923,1924,1925,1926,1927,1928,1929,1930,1931,1932,1933,1934,1935,1936,1937,1938,1939,1940,1946,1947,1948,1949,1952,1953,1954,1955,1956,1957,1958,1959,1960,1961,1962,1963,1964,1965,1966,1967],"projection_sha256":"9e0bf5c53230509231319c32e790c115d18b15c859154a259507381d1483db4f","source_layer":"received_biography"},"mentions":[{"id":"c-liangshu-041-wanggui-ws1512987:p010:m0000","start":0,"end":2,"surface":"劉瑴","kind":"person","person_id":"y4a_gmc_c6h","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"依本段完整句法及人物角色辨識；稱謂不跨朝代或換任套用。"},{"id":"c-liangshu-041-wanggui-ws1512987:p010:m0003","start":3,"end":5,"surface":"仲寶","kind":"person","person_id":"y4a_gmc_c6h","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"依本段完整句法及人物角色辨識；稱謂不跨朝代或換任套用。"},{"id":"c-liangshu-041-wanggui-ws1512987:p010:m0010","start":10,"end":12,"surface":"真長","kind":"person","person_id":"izd_fga_3aj","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"晉丹陽尹、劉氏祖先字真長，與既有晉劉真長/劉惔來源角色及時代相容，作有資格同指；不補七世中間代。"},{"id":"c-liangshu-041-wanggui-ws1512987:p010:m0041","start":41,"end":44,"surface":"湘東王","kind":"person","person_id":"rvc_bqx_v5w","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"依本段完整句法及人物角色辨識；稱謂不跨朝代或換任套用。"},{"id":"c-liangshu-041-wanggui-ws1512987:p010:m0059","start":59,"end":61,